 WIP: Incremental rewrite in Teal\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/wbthomason/packer.nvim/pull/639|#639 WIP: Incremental rewrite in Teal\u003e","text":"I would like to (incrementally) rewrite `packer.nvim` in Teal, to help catch bugs arising from Lua's weak, dynamic types.  \nAs a part of this process, I'm also going to refactor `packer` to use smaller functions/generally  \nclean up the code. This will hopefully make `packer` easier to maintain and remove some of the  \nobstacles to my continued maintenance, as well as remove bugs.\n\nThis PR is *very* WIP for the time being; I've only started converting the utility functions  \n`packer` defines. The nice part of Teal is that we can gradually convert parts of `packer` while  \nleaving the rest in Lua.","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/wbthomason/packer.nvim|wbthomason/packer.nvim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633557644}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/1l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1c5bd8d-b00f-42f7-a7b4-878477fb2ef6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確かに純粋に補完メニューのissuesは少ないか","ts":"1633708784.257900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wtN6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f4ac624-2d3c-42f2-9a9e-0477763ed040","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"想像よりはかなりマイルドですね。これならやっていけそうです。治せそうなものが多いですし。","ts":"1633706525.257300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zqD+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7aba3a2-7eb9-443c-a0b1-71ffa7cac0b9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"nvim-cmpのissuesの数がヤバい","ts":"1633706104.256600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LkY/"}]}]
